 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Level &amp; Skills' Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvlknights\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"> <div class=\"skills-box\"> <h3 class=\"skills-box-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-General\">General</span></h3> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Knights</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">?</span> and ? / ? (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Paladins</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">?</span> and ? / ? (Attk/Def)</div> <div class=\"skills-box-label\">Mages</div> <div class=\"skills-box-data\">Level <span style=\"color: green; font-weight: bold;\">?</span> and ? / ? (ML/Def)</div> </div></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Profit Hourly</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">Experience</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">Loot</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"exp\">?<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"></p></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"loot\">?<p style=\"text-align: center; margin: 0.4em 0 0.5em;\"></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Roshamuul Cistern Main Floor Marked\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"112\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Roshamuul_Cistern_Main_Floor_Marked_59f22c.png\" width=\"125\"/></span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Rosh cistern\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"94\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Rosh_cistern_8d73d1.gif\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <b>Roshamuul Cistern</b> is a large dungeon which acts as a reservoir for all of <a href=\"#/wiki/Roshamuul\">Roshamuul</a>. The dungeon is infested with <a href=\"#/wiki/Terrorsleep\">Terrorsleeps</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Feversleep\">Feversleeps</a> and has three <a href=\"#/wiki/Shiversleep\">Shiversleeps</a> which seem to manage the cistern. Most of the stairs in the cistern do not react like normal stairs, taking you to where you would not expect. However, unlike the <a href=\"#/wiki/Lower%20Roshamuul\">Lower Roshamuul</a> ramps, each staircase has a specific destination which does not change.\n</p><p><br/>\nSeveral parts of the <a href=\"#/quest/roshamuul-quest\">Roshamuul Quest</a> take place here.\n</p>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Roshamuul%20Quest%2FSpoiler\">Waters of Life</a> task takes place entirely in the cistern.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Roshamuul%20Quest%2FSpoiler\">Not Afraid Of The Dark</a> task can be worked on here as it has <a href=\"#/wiki/Terrorsleep\">Terrorsleeps</a>.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"#/wiki/Roshamuul%20Quest%2FSpoiler\">A Cup of Tea</a> task requires a <a href=\"#/wiki/Tea%20Spoon\">Tea Spoon</a> which can be found here.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Creatures\">Creatures</span></h2>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Creatures</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Terrorsleep\"><img alt=\"Terrorsleep\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Terrorsleep_278abb.gif\" width=\"64\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Terrorsleep\">Terrorsleep</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">7,240</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">7,200</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">?</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>4-197?× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-9× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potion</a> (common)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ultimate%20Health%20Potion\">Ultimate Health Potion</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\">Small Ruby</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Topaz\">Small Topaz</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Crystal%20Shard\">Blue Crystal Shard</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Trapped Bad Dream Monster (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Bowl of Terror Sweat (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Blue Crystal Splinter (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Cyan Crystal Fragment (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Amethyst\">Small Amethyst</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Broken%20Dream\">Broken Dream</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Piece%20of%20Cloth\">Blue Piece of Cloth</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Fish%20Fin\">Fish Fin</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Warrior%20Helmet\">Warrior Helmet</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/White%20Piece%20of%20Cloth\">White Piece of Cloth</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight%20Armor\">Knight Armor</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Robe\">Blue Robe</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Giant%20Sword\">Giant Sword</a> (semi-rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Red%20Piece%20of%20Cloth\">Red Piece of Cloth</a> (rare)</li>\n<li>Collar of Orange Plasma (rare)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Cluster%20of%20Solace\">Cluster of Solace</a> (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Feversleep\"><img alt=\"Feversleep\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"63\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Feversleep_ed02b6.gif\" width=\"58\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Feversleep\">Feversleep</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">5,060</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5,900</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">?</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li>1-100× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-9× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a> (common)</li>\n<li>1-2× <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Mana%20Potion\">Great Mana Potion</a> (common)</li>\n<li>Cyan Crystal Fragment (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Topaz\">Small Topaz</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\">Small Emerald</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li>Trapped Bad Dream Monster (uncommon)</li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Ruby\">Small Ruby</a> (uncommon)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ultima